  "name": "Autism Act 2009 Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Autism Act 2009 Committee was appointed to consider the Autism Act 2009 and to make recommendations.</p>\r\n<p>Follow the Committee on <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hlautismactcom.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/autism-act-2009-committee/\">LinkedIn</a>, or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/HLAutismActCom\">X (formerly Twitter)</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Read the Shorthand Story: <a href=\"https://ukparliament.shorthandstories.com/autism-act-special-inquiry-lords-report/index.html?utm_source=committees.parliament.uk&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=autism-act-special-inquiry-report&amp;utm_content=inquiry-page-banner\">Time to deliver: The Autism Act 2009 and the new autism strategy</a></p>\r\n<p>The report <a href=\"https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/ld5901/ldselect/ldautismact/205/205.pdf\">Time to deliver: The Autism Act 2009 and the new autism strategy</a> was published 23 November 2025, the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/autism-act-government-response-to-lords-select-committee-report\">Government Response</a> was published 23 Jaunuary 2026 and the <a href=\"https://hansard.parliament.uk/lords/2026-06-10/debates/5672314A-6170-48B6-9BEE-3F083DA8BC8C/NewAutismStrategy(AutismAct2009CommitteeReport)\">report was debated</a> 10 June 2026.</p>",
